"Ask Paymob to connect the merchants to your account and to enable split\n"
"                        amounts, then add them here with their share. For each item paid, every\n"
"                        merchant that applies to it receives its share of the item's price; the\n"
"                        rest is yours. Paymob pays each merchant its share."
msgstr ""
